{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2021-01-15 09:55:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ RESUMES TRADING IN GENERATIONS BANCORP NY, INC.', 'text': "NEW YORK, JAN. 15, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET® (NASDAQ: NDAQ) ANNOUNCED THAT TRADING RESUMED TODAY IN GENERATIONS BANCORP NY, INC. (NASDAQ: GBNY) AT 8:15 A.M. EASTERN TIME ON JANUARY 15, 2021. TRADING IN THE COMPANY'S STOCK WAS HALTED ON JANUARY 14, 2021 AT 17:10:16 EASTERN TIME."}